@startuml
hide empty description
[*] --> NotStarted : attempt created
NotStarted --> InProgress : student starts test
InProgress --> Submitted : student submits before deadline
InProgress --> Expired : server deadline reached
Submitted --> Evaluated : validate answers and calculate score
Expired --> Evaluated : auto-submit saved answers and calculate score
Evaluated --> [*] : result available

note right of Submitted
  Transient lifecycle state.
  The current service persists the final
  status as evaluated in one scoring call.
end note
note right of Expired
  Expiry triggers automatic grading;
  the current service then persists evaluated.
end note
note bottom of Evaluated
  Repeated submissions do not re-grade
  an evaluated attempt.
end note
@enduml
